  "selection": "Fixed explicit list of 13 standalone decks: BJT external-node DC sweeps, BJT temperature transients, diode sidewall temperature DC sweep, noise invalid-input regressions, JFET level-2 transient, MOS1 temperature/geometry DC sweeps and three MOS1 transient regressions. Seven tran, five dc and one noise; no AC or TF coverage claimed. Chosen by analysis/device family, absence from earlier manifests and no include dependencies before either engine ran. No success filtering, adaptations or tolerance changes. Xyce dialect rejections and deliberately invalid inputs are retained.",
  "mechanicalAdaptation": "none",
